Exclusion Criteria:

1. Patients who have not recovered from AEs caused by previous anti-tumor therapy to ≤ Grade 1 (assessed according to NCI-CTCAE 5.0 criteria, excluding alopecia and ≤ Grade 2 peripheral sensory neuropathy);
